    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Le r&#xe9;sultat escompt&#xe9; de ce projet est l&apos;obtention des installations de biologie plus durables en Jordanie afin d&#x2019;am&#xe9;liorer la pr&#xe9;vention, la d&#xe9;tection et la r&#xe9;ponse &#xe0; la prolif&#xe9;ration des mati&#xe8;res li&#xe9;es aux armes biologiques.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected outcome of this project is enhanced sustainability of biological facilities in Jordan for the improved prevention, detection and response to proliferation of biological-weapons related materials.</narrative>
